<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Automatisor - Customer Acquisition</title>
<meta name="description" content="Automatisor helps warehouse automation providers acquire, retain and expand customers using warehouse intelligence." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
<link rel="icon" href="/images/headerlogo.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<%- include('partials/analytics') %>
</head>
<body>

<div class="bg-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<%- include('partials/header', { showProductLink: false, headerCtaText: 'Start Free Trial' }) %>

<main>

  <video class="main-bg-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" aria-hidden="true">
    <source src="/images/herobgvideo.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <div class="main-bg-video-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <button type="button" class="badge-pill hero-badge-trigger" id="hero-badge-trigger" aria-haspopup="dialog">
              For<span class="sep">|</span><strong>Customer Acquistion</strong>
        </button>
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Built for system integrators &amp; robotics companies</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          Your next <span class="text-accent">warehouse deployment </span>starts here
        </h1>
        <h2 class="hero-sub">AI agents that discover, qualify and engage US facilities ideal to & ready for your solution</h2>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="https://app.automatisor.com" class="btn btn-light btn-lg btn-cta-trial">Start Free Trial</a>
          <a href="/demo" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Talk to us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-aside">
        <div class="hero-carousel" data-carousel aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="What Automatisor finds">
          <div class="hero-carousel-track">
            <!-- Card 1: ideal facility criteria -->
            <article class="hero-card is-active" data-carousel-slide aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 3">
              <div class="hero-card-body">
                <h3 class="hero-card-title">Find ideal facilities for me</h3>
                <p class="hero-card-label is-strong">Criteria</p>
                <div class="criteria-grid">
                  <div class="criteria-tile">
                    <p class="criteria-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 21V8l9-5 9 5v13"/><path d="M8 21v-7h8v7"/><path d="M12 14v7"/></svg>Site type</p>
                    <p class="criteria-value">Distribution center (DC)</p>
                    <p class="criteria-desc">Must be explicitly described as a DC in the site research.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="criteria-tile">
                    <p class="criteria-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="8" width="20" height="8" rx="1.5"/><path d="M6 8v3M10 8v4M14 8v3M18 8v4"/></svg>Size</p>
                    <p class="criteria-value">&ge; 100,000 sq ft</p>
                    <p class="criteria-desc">At least 100,000 square feet of area.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="criteria-tile">
                    <p class="criteria-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>Shifts</p>
                    <p class="criteria-value">2+ shifts</p>
                    <p class="criteria-desc"><span class="criteria-tag tag-blue">Evidence</span>Site-level or account-level</p>
                    <p class="criteria-desc"><span class="criteria-tag tag-red">Exclude</span>Site record explicitly says one shift</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="criteria-tile">
                    <p class="criteria-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M2.5 20c0-3.6 2.9-6 6.5-6s6.5 2.4 6.5 6"/><path d="M16 4.7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 6.6M18 14.3c2.1.7 3.5 2.9 3.5 5.7"/></svg>Labor</p>
                    <p class="criteria-value">Labor issues present</p>
                    <p class="criteria-desc"><span class="criteria-tag tag-blue">Primary</span>Site-level evidence</p>
                    <p class="criteria-desc"><span class="criteria-tag tag-amber">Fallback</span>Account-level labor urgency, only if site has no labor signal</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Card 2: facilities matching the criteria. The first row's "Why?"
                 panel is always shown, it can't be collapsed. -->
            <article class="hero-card" data-carousel-slide aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 3">
              <div class="hero-card-body">
                <h3 class="hero-card-title">Found facilities that match</h3>
                <div class="match-table" role="table" aria-label="Facilities that match criteria">
                  <div class="match-row match-head" role="row">
                    <span role="columnheader"><span class="sr-only">Details</span></span>
                    <span role="columnheader">Account</span>
                    <span role="columnheader">Facility</span>
                    <span role="columnheader" class="match-fit-head">IFP Fitment</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="match-item is-open">
                    <div class="match-row" role="row">
                      <span class="match-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                      <span role="cell" class="match-account"><span class="match-logo">TG</span>Target</span>
                      <span role="cell">2050 E Beamer St, Woodland, CA 95776</span>
                      <span role="cell"><span class="match-fit">High</span></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="match-why">
                      <strong>Why?</strong>
                      <p>High fit for the criteria because it is a documented regional DC with a 344,065-square-foot addition, two operating shifts, and clear labor-pressure signals. Site evidence includes ongoing warehouse and operations hiring, physically demanding work, long holiday hours, and negative pay and management themes.</p>
                      <strong class="match-details">Details &rarr;</strong>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="match-row" role="row">
                    <span class="match-toggle is-static" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span role="cell" class="match-account"><span class="match-logo">TG</span>Target</span>
                    <span role="cell">1100 Valley Rd, Oconomowoc, WI 53066</span>
                    <span role="cell"><span class="match-fit">High</span></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="match-row" role="row">
                    <span class="match-toggle is-static" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span role="cell" class="match-account"><span class="match-logo">Ad</span>Allen Distribution</span>
                    <span role="cell">34 Dauphin Dr, Mechanicsburg, PA 17050</span>
                    <span role="cell"><span class="match-fit">High</span></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Card 3: facility fit -->
            <article class="hero-card" data-carousel-slide aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="3 of 3">
              <div class="hero-card-body">
                <h3 class="hero-card-title">Regional DC</h3>
                <p class="hero-card-sub">Target, 2050 E Beamer St, Woodland, CA 95776</p>
                <dl class="hero-card-stats">
                  <div><dt>Size</dt><dd>1.86 M sq ft</dd></div>
                  <div><dt>Shifts</dt><dd>2 per day</dd></div>
                  <div><dt>Trailer loading</dt><dd>FKI Logistex extendable conveyor, Pallet Jacks</dd></div>
                </dl>
                <p class="hero-card-label">Signals found</p>
                <ul class="hero-card-signals">
                  <li>Large, multi-shift distribution operation</li>
                  <li>Labor-intensive work with ongoing hiring</li>
                  <li>Trailer loading automation already in use</li>
                  <li>Material-handling safety exposure - hand injury at conveyor belt</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="hero-card-label">Fit with your solutions</p>
                <ul class="hero-card-fits">
                  <li><span>AMR-assisted pallet handling</span><span class="fit-tag fit-strong">Strong fit</span></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <p class="hero-card-foot">40 contacts found &middot; outreach drafted &middot; ready to send</p>
            </article>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-carousel-progress">
            <span class="hero-carousel-line" aria-hidden="true"><span class="hero-carousel-line-fill" data-carousel-fill></span></span>
            <button type="button" class="hero-carousel-point" data-carousel-dot aria-label="Show card 1"></button>
            <button type="button" class="hero-carousel-point" data-carousel-dot aria-label="Show card 2"></button>
            <button type="button" class="hero-carousel-point" data-carousel-dot aria-label="Show card 3"></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ HAND US A MARKET PANEL ============ -->
  <section class="market-panel-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="market-panel">
        <div class="market-panel-head">
          <h2>Your scarcest resource is time.<br>Spend it on the right warehouses.</h2>
          <p>Conversations, Google, Linkedin, Maps, Glassdoor, Indeed, Publications, Company website, Case Studies, Blogs, Local News, Financial Reports, Images, Regulatory Filings, Employee Reviews.... <br><br> 47 open tabs, hours gone into research, still unsure if this warehouse is worth my time! Sounds familiar? </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS: AGENT FLOW ============
       Five steps left to right, joined by labelled arrows. Below 1100px the
       grid collapses to a single column and the arrows point down. -->
  <section class="flow-section" aria-label="How Automatisor builds your pipeline">
    <div class="container flow-intro">
      <div class="step-row-head">
        <h2 class="step-row-eyebrow">How Automatisor works</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="step-row">
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <p>Uncover signals of automation need from deeply researched facility level insights across all your target accounts & facilities</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <p>Qualify facilities which are ideal & for your solutions</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <p>Prospect the right people with ready-to-send outreach campaigns drafted in 10 mins, prep for discovery</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-canvas">

      <div class="flow-step flow-step-1">
        <span class="flow-tile"><img src="/images/headerlogo.svg" alt=""></span>
        <p class="flow-num">Step 1</p>
        <h3 class="flow-title">Discovery Agent</h3>
        <p class="flow-desc">Builds a target list of warehouses for you</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-link"><span class="flow-link-label">Account list</span><svg viewBox="0 0 56 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12h48M42 4l10 8-10 8"/></svg></div>

      <div class="flow-step flow-step-2">
        <span class="flow-tile"><img src="/images/headerlogo.svg" alt=""></span>
        <p class="flow-num">Step 2</p>
        <h3 class="flow-title">Research Agent</h3>
        <p class="flow-desc">Deeply researches a facility to uncover signals of automation need</p>
        <span class="flow-arrow-up"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 44" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 42V6M4 14l8-10 8 10"/></svg></span>
        <div class="flow-sources">
          <ul class="flow-chips">
            <li class="flow-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M7 9h10M7 12h10M7 15h6"/></svg><span>News<br>Archives</span></li>
            <li class="flow-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c3 3 3 15 0 18M12 3c-3 3-3 15 0 18"/></svg><span>State &amp; Local<br>Registries</span></li>
            <li class="flow-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 3h7l4 4v14H7z"/><path d="M14 3v4h4M10 12h5M10 16h5"/></svg><span>Regulatory<br>Filings</span></li>
            <li class="flow-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 11l8-7 8 7v9H4z"/><path d="M10 20v-6h4v6"/></svg><span>Property<br>Records</span></li>
            <li class="flow-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M14.5 9.2c-.4-.8-1.3-1.2-2.5-1.2-1.4 0-2.4.7-2.4 1.8 0 2.5 5 1.2 5 3.7 0 1.1-1 1.8-2.6 1.8-1.2 0-2.2-.5-2.6-1.4M12 6.5V8M12 16v1.5"/></svg><span>Job<br>Boards</span></li>
            <li class="flow-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 8V6a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 011 1v2M3 13h18"/></svg><span>Financial<br>Disclosures</span></li>
            <li class="flow-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 16v-4M12 16V8M16 16v-6"/></svg><span>Industry<br>Reports</span></li>
            <li class="flow-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="7" ry="3"/><path d="M5 6v6c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3V6M5 12v6c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3v-6"/></svg><span>Company<br>Websites</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="flow-sources-caption">Pre-vetted &amp; validated sources<small>data collected by the Research Agent</small></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-link"><span class="flow-link-label">Researched warehouses</span><svg viewBox="0 0 56 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12h48M42 4l10 8-10 8"/></svg></div>

      <div class="flow-step flow-step-3">
        <p class="flow-num">Step 3</p>
        <h3 class="flow-title">Facility Intelligence</h3>
        <p class="flow-desc">One living digital model for each warehouse</p>
        <img class="flow-facility" src="/images/facility-intelligence.png" alt="Layered digital model of a warehouse" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <div class="flow-link"><span class="flow-link-label">&ldquo;Need&rdquo; signals</span><svg viewBox="0 0 56 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12h48M42 4l10 8-10 8"/></svg></div>

      <div class="flow-step flow-step-4">
        <div class="flow-agent-row">
          <span class="flow-tile"><img src="/images/headerlogo.svg" alt=""></span>
          <div>
            <p class="flow-num">Step 4</p>
            <h3 class="flow-title">Qualifying Agent</h3>
            <p class="flow-desc">Decides if a warehouse is a good fit for a solution from signals of automation need</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-down"><span class="flow-arrow-down"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 44" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v36M4 30l8 10 8-10"/></svg></span><span class="flow-link-label">Good fits</span></div>
        <div class="flow-agent-row">
          <span class="flow-tile"><img src="/images/headerlogo.svg" alt=""></span>
          <div>
            <p class="flow-num">Step 5</p>
            <h3 class="flow-title">Prospecting Agent</h3>
            <p class="flow-desc">Creates a prospecting plan covering who to contact, what to say &amp; which signals of automation-need matter the most to them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-down"><span class="flow-arrow-down"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 44" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v36M4 30l8 10 8-10"/></svg></span></div>
        <div class="flow-pipeline">
          <h3>Deal pipeline of good-fit warehouses</h3>
          <ul class="flow-wh-row">
          <li class="flow-wh"><span class="flow-tick" aria-hidden="true">&check;</span><img src="/images/warehouse.png" alt="Good-fit warehouse" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li class="flow-wh"><span class="flow-tick" aria-hidden="true">&check;</span><img src="/images/warehouse.png" alt="Good-fit warehouse" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li class="flow-wh"><span class="flow-tick" aria-hidden="true">&check;</span><img src="/images/warehouse.png" alt="Good-fit warehouse" loading="lazy"></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ INTERACTIVE DEMO ============ -->
  <section class="demo-section" id="demo">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head section-head-center">
        <h2>Experience for yourself</h2>
        <p>Experience Automatisor in action through this interactive demo</p>
      </div>
      <div class="storylane-embed">
        <script async src="https://js.storylane.io/js/v2/storylane.js" data-verify-origin=""></script>
        <div class="sl-embed" style="position:relative;padding-bottom:calc(68.71% + 25px);width:100%;height:0;transform:scale(1)">
          <iframe loading="lazy" class="sl-demo" src="https://app.storylane.io/demo/kxt8gykqezim?embed=inline" name="sl-embed" allow="fullscreen" allowfullscreen style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;border:1px solid rgba(63,95,172,0.35);box-shadow: 0px 0px 18px rgba(26, 19, 72, 0.15);border-radius:10px;box-sizing:border-box;"></iframe>
        </div>
        <div aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" inert style="display:none;visibility:hidden;width:1px;height:1px;">Automatisor is a sales pipeline tool for warehouse automation vendors. This demo covers three capabilities: identifying which warehouse facilities to prospect, evaluating fit against your ideal customer profile, and generating personalized outreach campaigns.

Automatisor researches warehousing facilities to surface buying signals related to operations, labor, inventory, infrastructure, customers, and financials. Signals include labor strain, broken processes, expansion plans, and operation closures. An "Ask Automatisor" chat interface lets users investigate any signal in depth. It functions as an on-demand account research assistant with knowledge of warehousing operations and the user's own products.

Each facility is scored for fit against the user's specific solution and Ideal Facility Profiles. Users can query why a given facility or Ideal Facility Profile segments received a particular fit rating. This scoring focuses prospecting activity on facilities that match defined target criteria.

For outreach, users configure campaign goals and messaging strategies at varying levels of personalization: account-level, department-level, title-level, or individual-level. Automatisor recommends relevant buying signals for each messaging variant. A single action generates a personalized outreach sequence based on the selected goals and messaging strategy. The resulting sequence can be deployed directly into email automation platforms via a one-click integration.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

